      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "New columns cannot be forgotten: the export reads only the inventory, and the check fails while the schema holds anything the inventory does not.\nRetention is a table of rules, run by a batched job; a legal hold wins over a policy.",
